<title>HUNGARY: Hungary twelve-month bill yield falls to 20.07 pct.</title>
<headline>Hungary twelve-month bill yield falls to 20.07 pct.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-03-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>The average annual yield on the latest issue of 12-month discount treasury bills was set by auction at 20.07 percent, down from 20.31 percent at an auction two weeks ago, the Government Debt Management Centre said. </p>
<p>    Total on offer	     15,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total bids received	30,424.71 million forints</p>
<p>    Total allocated	    15,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Total issued		 18,000 million forints</p>
<p>    Average annual yield	    20.07 pct</p>
<p>    Average price		     83.3993</p>
</text>
